# Web Project Tasks (Frontend + Backend)
# Copy to project root as .tasks

# Frontend
0|Frontend|SUB|Frontend tasks
1|FE Install|cd frontend && npm install|Frontend: Install dependencies
1|FE Dev|cd frontend && npm run dev|Frontend: Start dev server
1|FE Build|cd frontend && npm run build|Frontend: Build production
1|FE Lint|cd frontend && npm run lint|Frontend: Lint code
1|FE Test|cd frontend && npm run test|Frontend: Run tests
1|Back|BACK

# Backend
0|Backend|SUB|Backend tasks
1|BE Install|cd backend && npm install|Backend: Install dependencies
1|BE Dev|cd backend && npm run dev|Backend: Start dev server
1|BE Build|cd backend && npm run build|Backend: Build production
1|BE Lint|cd backend && npm run lint|Backend: Lint code
1|BE Test|cd backend && npm run test|Backend: Run tests
1|Back|BACK

# Database
0|Database|SUB|Database tasks
1|DB Migrate|cd backend && npm run db:migrate|Database: Run migrations
1|DB Seed|cd backend && npm run db:seed|Database: Seed data
1|DB Reset|cd backend && npm run db:reset|Database: Reset
1|Back|BACK

# Quality
0|QA Full|npm run lint && npm run test && npm run build|Quality: Full checks

# Docker
0|Docker|SUB|Docker operations
1|Docker Build|docker-compose build|Docker: Build all
1|Docker Up|docker-compose up|Docker: Start services
1|Docker Down|docker-compose down|Docker: Stop services
1|Back|BACK

# Deployment
0|Deployment|SUB|Deployment tasks
1|Deploy Dev|docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d|Deploy: Dev environment
1|Deploy Prod|docker build -t app:prod . && docker push app:prod && kubectl apply -f k8s/|Deploy: Production
1|Back|BACK

# Monitoring
0|Monitoring|SUB|Service logs
1|Logs Frontend|cd frontend && npm run logs|Logs: Frontend
1|Logs Backend|cd backend && npm run logs|Logs: Backend
1|Back|BACK

# Full Setup
0|Full Setup|run --across backend,frontend install && run db:migrate [depends: FE Install,BE Install]|Setup: Everything

0|Exit|EXIT|Close menu
